</code></pre> <p><code>&lt;input appAutofocus /&gt;</code> had focus after rendering (<code>document.activeElement</code> was that input). Touching <code>nativeElement</code> directly is fine for focus and measurement, but prefer host bindings for anything that can be expressed declaratively — they work with server-side rendering, where there's no real DOM to call <code>.focus()</code> on.</p>

